      ],
      "source": "https://www.orangecountyhistory.org/wp/?page_id=175"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 1909 transaction turned a local general store into the Three‑A Store, a landmark that still echoes the town’s early commerce.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
